ntifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/dropLast(_:)":{"abstract":[],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/dropLast(_:)","title":"dropLast(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/droplast(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropLast","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"title":"MaximalCliques","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]}}}